# arc_hole.sm -- A hole near a rounded corner, clear of its arc
# Copyright (c) 2026 Jakob Kastelic

# Fuzzer finding: the hole was rejected, measured to the whole circle
# of the arc.
sheet 1 1 0.4
plate base 0 0 100 50 origin 0 0 0 axes +x +y
round base 10 at 0 0 0
hole 6 20 8 along z
